{"name": "Revenant Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenant Survivors is a horde survival action roguelite where hard-hitting combat lets you carve through relentless hordes. In a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy world, absorb souls, steal the power of bosses, and evolve into something far more monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating a boss is more than a reward. Everything a fallen boss possessed can become your power. Absorb their soul to grow stronger, steal their skills and wield them yourself, claim the gear they leave behind, and take their very body to unlock a new playable character. After every boss kill, choose a Perk that can fundamentally change how your attacks work\u2014and how the slaughter unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic Attacks, Active Skills, and Dominions evolve into new forms as they grow. Progression changes more than damage: it can alter their area, how many times they activate, how long they last, and even how they trigger. The same attack can evolve to sweep across the battlefield or strike again and again, taking on a completely different form and role depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most level-ups let you strengthen your build through passive upgrades, while key levels allow you to choose and upgrade Basic Attack stages, Dominions, and Smashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon mini-bosses to earn Relics that reinforce specific build paths, defeat bosses to choose Perks that can reshape how your attacks work, and hunt for equipment to push your build even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Layer these choices together to create a combat style of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.poster.avif?t=1788526625\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.webm?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.mp4?t=1788526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your growth doesn't end when the battle does. Use souls earned on the battlefield to expand the Soul Altar and unlock new Dominions and progression choices. Craft and enhance equipment, and use permanent progression systems to strengthen both Player Abilities and Character Abilities. Return stronger to take on new battlefields and higher difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Revenant Survivors is a horde survival action roguelite set in a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy world. Tear through endless hordes with hard-hitting combat, absorb souls, and steal bosses' skills\u2014even their bodies\u2014to become evil incarnate.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/2d27daa328161dc872d1297ccb23ad59ff769bdc/header.jpg?t=1788526625", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Action", "Roguelite", "Action RPG"], "developers": "Mongma Studio", "publishers": "Mongma Studio", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4617500", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/StHgcMhbzBM", "first_seen": 1788472800.0, "review_rank": 1}